# Sanitized Convex Cloud Deployment & Bidirectional HMAC Verification Log
# Personal identifiers, deployment slugs, emails, and secrets replaced with placeholders.

$ cd /workspace/lendloop
$ npx convex env set CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN https://<your-clerk-domain>.clerk.accounts.dev
✔ Successfully set CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN (on dev deployment <convex-deployment>)
$ npx convex env set INITIAL_ADMIN_EMAIL <admin-email>
✔ Successfully set INITIAL_ADMIN_EMAIL (on dev deployment <convex-deployment>)
$ npx convex env set N8N_WEBHOOK_HMAC_SECRET <redacted-64-char-hex-secret>
✔ Successfully set N8N_WEBHOOK_HMAC_SECRET (on dev deployment <convex-deployment>)

$ npx convex dev --once
✔ Convex functions ready! (3.71s)

# Live HTTP Action Security Verification against https://<convex-deployment>.convex.site

1. Unsigned request -> GET /api/n8n/overdue-loans
   HTTP 401 -> {"error":"Missing timestamp or signature header"}

2. Tampered signature -> GET /api/n8n/overdue-loans (valid X-LendLoop-Timestamp, forged X-LendLoop-Signature)
   HTTP 401 -> {"error":"Invalid HMAC signature"}

3. Stale replay request -> GET /api/n8n/overdue-loans (timestamp -360s, valid HMAC over stale timestamp)
   HTTP 401 -> {"error":"Request timestamp outside allowed replay window"}

4. Valid HMAC-signed query -> GET /api/n8n/overdue-loans (signature = HMAC_SHA256(secret, "${ts}.GET:/api/n8n/overdue-loans"))
   HTTP 200 -> {"date":"2026-11-17","loans":[]}

5. Valid HMAC-signed error visibility callback -> POST /api/n8n/error-report
   Payload: {"workflowName":"demo-verification-check","message":"Synthetic smoke-test error log"}
   HTTP 200 -> {"recorded":true}
